+/* ORD-0261: the bar's gradient paints over whatever scrolls beneath it, and measured at 390x844 the
+   "高级设置" summary's centre landed on the bar's 下一步 button -- a control hidden by chrome. The bar
+   keeps its job (the primary action stays reachable); the scrolling content (.trial-steps wraps all
+   step content) now ends above the bar, so at rest it overlaps only the bar's own padding.  The
